module stratatree

; The tree, with identity separated from address.
;
; This layer adds no primitive and widens nothing. The identity split is
; Strata's own -- `strata/system/tree.strata` -- and the only thing Meta
; contributes is the source list the checks link.

judgment StrataTreeSystem [prelude native octets artifact collections changeset tree] =
  list [prelude native octets artifact collections changeset tree]
